  "The compiler message above is shown as-is. If it names a line, start there; otherwise open the raw output below to see what came just before it.": "上面是编译器的原始信息。如果它给出了行号就从那一行看起；没有行号就展开下方原始输出，看它前面几行发生了什么。",
  "The .bib file has a malformed or duplicated entry at this line; bibtex/biber skipped it, so any citation of it stays unresolved. Fix the entry (usually a missing comma or brace on the previous field) and recompile.": ".bib 文件这一行的条目格式有误或重复，bibtex/biber 已跳过它，引用它的地方会一直显示未定义。修好该条目（通常是上一字段末尾少了逗号或花括号）再编译。",
  "The LaTeX executable could not be found. Install a TeX distribution or configure its path in Settings → LaTeX; your document can still be edited.": "找不到 LaTeX 可执行程序。请安装 TeX 发行版，或在“设置 → LaTeX”里配置路径；文档仍然可以编辑。",
  "Check the path relative to the project main and the installed package version. Typst package downloads require your confirmation.": "检查相对于主文件的路径是否正确，以及所需宏包是否已安装。Typst 宏包下载需要你确认。",
  "Check installed fonts. For a Unicode or fontspec LaTeX document, select XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX in Typesetting.": "检查字体是否已安装。使用 Unicode 或 fontspec 的 LaTeX 文档需要在“排版”里选择 XeLaTeX 或 LuaLaTeX。",
  "The typesetting engine is unavailable. Check the local installation and configured executable path; nothing will be installed automatically.": "排版引擎不可用。检查本机安装和配置的可执行文件路径；不会自动安装任何东西。",
  "Check spelling and the definition/import before this use. A formula-only preview does not inherit document macros.": "检查拼写，以及这个命令在使用前是否已定义或引入。单独的公式预览不会继承文档里的宏。",
  "Inspect this location and the preceding line for an unmatched brace, bracket, delimiter or environment.": "检查这一行和上一行有没有没配对的花括号、方括号、定界符或环境。",
  "The document compiled, but this line does not fit comfortably. Adjust the wording, line break or figure width rather than hiding the warning.": "文档已编译成功，但这一行排不下。可以调整措辞、换行位置或图片宽度，不必隐藏这个警告。",
  "The bibliography tool could not be found. Check that the backend selected by the document (bibtex or biber) is installed and available in the TeX environment. Recompiling alone will not install it.": "找不到参考文献处理工具。请检查文档选用的后端（bibtex 或 biber）是否已安装，并能在 TeX 环境中找到；重复编译不会自动安装它。",
  "The bibliography database (.bib) or style (.bst) could not be opened. Check the named file and its path relative to the main document; another compile will not restore a missing file.": "无法打开参考文献库（.bib）或样式（.bst）。请检查上面提到的文件及其相对于主文档的路径；重复编译无法找回缺失的文件。",
  "The bibliography processor reported a failure. Expand the raw output for its specific error, then check the named .bib entry, file or backend setting. Running it again without fixing the cause may repeat the failure.": "参考文献处理失败。请展开原始输出，查看具体错误，再检查对应的 .bib 条目、文件或后端配置；不解决原因就重编译，可能仍会失败。",
  "The same label is defined more than once. Find its label definitions in the project and rename or remove the duplicate; compiling again alone cannot fix this.": "同一个标签被定义了多次。请在项目中查找对应的标签定义，重命名或删除重复项；单纯重编译无法修复。",
  "Cross references and citations may need additional passes. Compile again with latexmk. If they remain unresolved, check earlier bibliography errors, the loaded .bib files and the spelling of citation keys or labels.": "交叉引用和文献引用可能还需要编译几遍。可以用 latexmk 再编译一次；若仍未解析，请检查前面的文献处理错误、是否加载了正确的 .bib 文件，以及引用键或标签的拼写。",
  "No matching entry was found in the loaded .bib files. Check the key and bibliography source.": "在已加载的 .bib 文件中未找到匹配条目，请检查引用键和文献库来源。",
  "Could not read bibliography entries. Try hovering again.": "暂时无法读取参考文献条目，请再次悬停重试。"
